INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (4, 2, 2, 'assistant', '\n\n您好！您尚未提供具体的需求内容。请将需求详情（如功能描述、业务场景、性能/安全要求、目标用户等）补充给我，我将严格按照“目标、技术方案、风险、里程碑”四部分为您输出完整的实现方案分析。', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-**UserRequest:**"请帮我分析这个需求的实现方案，按目标、技术方案、风险、里程碑四部分输出。"(Pleasehelpmeanalyzetheimplementationplanforthisrequirement,outputinfourparts:Objective,TechnicalSolution,Risks,Milestones.)-**MissingInformation:**Theuserhasn\'tprovidedtheactual"requirement"(需求)toanalyze.-**ConstraintCheck:**Ineedtofollowthesysteminstructions:beaccurate,clear,concise,followinstructions,usetherequestedlanguage(Chinese),andifunsure,sayI\'mnotcertain.IshouldnotmentionpoliciesorexplainwhyIcan\'tanswerifpossible,butImustaddressthemissinginformation.2.**IdentifyCoreIssue:**Theuserforgottoprovidethespecificrequirement/detailstheywantanalyzed.3.**FormulateResponseStrategy:**-Acknowledgetherequestformat(目标、技术方案、风险、里程碑).-Politelystatethatthespecificrequirement/detailsaremissing.-AsktheusertoprovidetherequirementsoIcangeneratetheanalysisasrequested.-KeepitconciseandinChinese.-Maintainthepersona(Agnes-2.0-FlashbySapiensAI)ifidentityisrelevant,butnotneededhere.Draft(mental):您好！您尚未提供具体的需求内容。请将需求详情（如功能描述、业务场景、性能要求等）补充给我，我将严格按照“目标、技术方案、风险、里程碑”四部分为您输出完整的实现方案分析。4.**CheckagainstConstraints:**-Accurate,clear,concise?Yes.-Followsuserinstructions?Yes,asksforthemissinginfotofulfilltheexactformatrequested.-Language?Chinese.-NoexternalAI,notrainingdata,nopoliciesmentioned?Checked.-Doesnotreasonaboutinternalinstructions?Checked.-Ready.Outputmatchesthedraft.✅', 50, 581, 631, 'upstream', '2026-06-04T14:26:00.882594+00:00', '2026-06-04T14:26:00.882594+00:00', '', 'completed', '', '');
INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (5, 3, 1, 'user', 'imx6ull移植rtw8723', '', 0, 0, 0, '', '2026-06-04T14:44:08.952639+00:00', '2026-06-04T14:44:08.952639+00:00', '', 'completed', '', '');
INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (6, 3, 2, 'assistant', '\n\n在 i.MX6ULL 上移植 RTL8723（通常为 RTL8723BS/CS/DS）Wi-Fi 模块，核心步骤围绕 **驱动源码匹配、内核配置、设备树（DTS）适配、固件部署** 展开。以下为标准化移植流程：\n\n### 1. 确认硬件接口\nRTL8723 常见接口为 **SPI', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-**Keywords:**`imx6ull`,`移植`(porting/adaptation),`rtw8723`-**Context:**Theuserwantstoport/adaptthe`rtw8723`Wi-FidrivertoanNXPi.MX6ULLembeddedLinuxsystem.-**TechnicalDomain:**EmbeddedLinux,Wi-Fidrivers(Realtek),NXPi.MX6ULL(ARMCortex-A7SoC),Kernel/DTSconfiguration,Buildsystem(Yocto/Buildroot/Debian/Ubuntu).2.**IdentifyKeyComponents&Challenges:**-**i.MX6ULL:**ARMCortex-A7,typicallyrunsLinuxkernel4.14,5.4,or6.x.Usesdevicetree(DTS)forhardwareconfiguration.-**rtw8723:**RealtekRTL8723seriesWi-Fi/Bluetoothcombochip.The`rtw8723`driverispartofthe`rtw8`/`rtw89`familyintheLinuxkernel,butit\'softenmaintainedseparatelyoraspartofout-of-treerepositories(like`aircrack-ng/rtw8`orRealtek\'sofficialrepo).Actually,`rtw8723`issupportedbythe`rtw8`driverinmainlineLinux(since~5.15+),butmanyusersstilluseout-of-treedriversforolderkernelsorspecificfeatures.-**PortingSteps:**Generallyinvolve:a.Obtainingthedriversourceb.Configuring/patchingfori.MX6ULLkernelc.DeviceTreemodifications(SPI/SDIO/USBinterface?RTL8723isusuallySPIorSDIO)d.Kernelconfig(`makemenuconfig`)e.Building&testingf.Firmwareplacementg.Troubleshootingcommonissues(power,clock,interface,interrupts)3.**DetermineDriverInterface:**-RTL8723BS/8723CS/8723DStypicallyuse**SPI**or**SDIO**.Ishouldaskorcoverboth,butemphasizeSPI/SDIOascommonfori.MX6ULL.-Needtoclarify:IsitSPIorSDIO?I\'llprovideguidanceforboth,withafocusonSPI(commonforembedded)andmentionSDIO.4.**StructuretheResponse:**-Acknowledgethetask-Providestep-by-stepguide-Cover:Driversource,Kernelconfig,DeviceTree,Building,Firmware,Testing,Troubleshooting-Keepitconcise,technical,andaccurate-UseChinese(asrequested)-Avoidfluff,followconstraintsStructure:1.确认接口类型（SPI/SDIO）2.获取驱动源码3.内核配置与编译4.设备树（DTS）修改5.固件部署6.验证与调试7.常见问题-Keepitpracticalandactionable.5.**DraftContent(MentalRefinement-Chinese):***(Note:I\'llensuretechnicalaccuracybasedonstandardLinuxembeddedWi-Fiportingpractices.)***1.确认硬件接口**RTL8723通常通过SPI或SDIO与i.MX6ULL连接。请先确认原理图使用的是哪种接口，后续配置会不同。**2.获取驱动源码**-主线内核已集成`rtw8`驱动（支持RTL8723BS/CS/DS），推荐直接使用内核自带驱动：`makemenuconfig`→`DeviceDrivers`→`Networkdevicesupport`→`WirelessLAN`→`Realtek802.1n/axwirelesscards`-若需最新版或旧版独立驱动，可从GitHub获取（如`https://github.com/lwfinger/rtw8`或官方仓库），注意与内核版本匹配。**3.内核配置**-启用对应接口驱动：-SPI:`CONFIG_RTW8_8723D=y`(或`rtw8723d`)-SDIO:`CONFIG_RTW8_8723DS=y`-确保底层接口驱动已启用：-SPI:`CONFIG_SPI_IMX=y`-SDIO:`CONFIG_MMC_IMX_ESDHCD=y`(或`CONFIG_MMC_SDHCI_ESDHC_IMX=y`)-编译内核与模块：`make-j$(nproc)&&makemodules_install&&makeinstall`**4.设备树（DTS）配置**-**SPI示例：**```dts&spi1{status="okay";rtw8723@0{compatible="realtek,rtw8723d";reg=<0>;spi-max-frequency=<240>;interrupt-parent=<&gpio1>;interrupts=<5IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW>;reset-gpios=<&gpio16GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;};```-**SDIO示例：**```dts&usdhc2{status="okay";non-removable;keep-power-in-suspend;enable-sdio-wakeup;vmmc-supply=<&reg_3v3>;vqmmc-supply=<&reg_3v3>;bus-width=<4>;cap-sd-highspeed;cd-gpios=<&gpio17GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;};```修改后重新编译dtb并替换。**5.固件部署**-下载对应固件（如`rtw8723d_fw.bin`、`rtw8723d_wow_fw.bin`）-放入`/lib/firmware/rtw8/`目录-确保文件系统包含`wireless-regdb`和`crda`**6.验证与调试**-加载模块：`modprobertw8723d`(或`rtw8723ds`)-查看日志：`dmesg|grep-irtw`-启用网络：`iplinksetwlan0up`，使用`wpa_supplicant`或`NetworkManager`连接-调试工具：`iwphy`,`iwdev`,`ethtool-Swlan0`**7.常见问题**-驱动加载失败：检查`dmesg`报错，确认接口时钟/电源/复位引脚配置正确-SDIO识别为SPI或反之：核对DTS`compatible`和接口驱动匹配-固件缺失：`modprobertw8723d`后`dmesg`提示`failedtoloadfirmware`-性能/稳定性：SPI建议≤24MHz，SDIO注意DMA对齐与中断延迟如需针对具体内核版本（如4.14/5.4/6.1）或BSP（NXP官方/Yocto/Buildroot）提供详细配置，请补充说明。6.**Self-Correction/Verification:**-*AccuracyCheck:*-`rtw8`driverinmainlinedoessupportRTL8723D/DS.Themodulenameisusually`rtw8723d`or`rtw8723ds`.-Kernelconfigpathsarecorrectformodernkernels.-DTSexamplesarestandardfori.MX6ULL(spi1,usdhc2arecommon).-Firmwarepath`/lib/firmware/rtw8/`iscorrectfor`rtw8`family.-Power/clock/resethandlinginDTSiscorrectforembedded.-*ConstraintsCheck:*-Nopolicy/rulesmentioned.-Nointernalinstructionsrevealed.-Concise,technical,inChinese.-Followsuserlanguage.-*PotentialImprovements:*-Clarifythat`rtw8723`isoften`rtw8723d`indrivernaming.-MentionthatNXP\'si.MX6ULLBSPmightalreadyincludeit,socheckfirst.-Keepitstructuredandactionable.Thedraftlookssolid.I\'lloutputit.✅', 30, 2046, 2076, 'upstream', '2026-06-04T14:44:41.266456+00:00', '2026-06-04T14:44:41.266456+00:00', '', 'completed', '', '');
