INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (20, 1, 6, 'assistant', '\n\n`.voicebox.zip` 通常是该项目或其所依附软件自定义的音频归档格式，并非标准音频文件。导入声音一般可按以下路径操作：\n\n1. **验证是否为标准 ZIP**：尝试将文件后缀直接改为 `.zip`，用 7-Zip 或系统自带解压工具打开。若能正常解压，说明内部是普通音频（如 WAV/MP3），可按项目要求的目录结构重新打包。\n2. **查看项目文档**：打开该仓库的 `README.md`，搜索 `import`、`voicebox`、`audio`、`format` 或 `pack`。多数此类项目会提供转换命令或 Python 脚本（例如 `python tools/convert.py input.wav output.voicebox.zip`）。\n3. **使用内置工具**：检查仓库中的 `scripts/`、`tools/`、`bin/` 或 `cli.py` 等目录，通常包含打包/解包/验证音频的命令行工具。\n4. **对照示例文件**：仓库一般会提供 `examples/` 或 `test_assets/`。解压官方示例的 `.voicebox.zip`，观察其内部 JSON 配置与音频文件的对应关系，按相同结构替换你的声音文件。\n5. **注意元数据/配置**：该格式可能要求附带描述文件（如角色信息、采样率、语音参数等），替换音频时不要遗漏配置文件。\n\n如果你能提供该项目的 `README` 关键段落、报错日志或你希望导入的具体音频格式，我可以给出更精确的命令或步骤。由于我无法实时抓取 GitHub 内容，操作时请以仓库官方说明为准。', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-**URL:**`https://github.com/jamiepine/voicebox`-**Question:**Howtoimportaudiointhisproject?Theusermentionsitseemstorequireafilenamed`xxxx.voicebox.zip`.-**Language:**Chinese2.**IdentifyKeyEntities/Concepts:**-Project:`jamiepine/voicebox`onGitHub-Feature:Importingaudio/voice-Fileformatmentioned:`.voicebox.zip`3.**Research/Verify(InternalKnowledge&Reasoning):**-Ineedtocheckwhat`jamiepine/voicebox`is.Basedonmytrainingdata,Idon\'thavedirectlivebrowsingcapabilities,butIcanreasonaboutcommonGitHubprojectsandthenamingconvention.-"Voicebox"onGitHubcouldberelatedtoaudioprocessing,TTS,voicecloning,oraspecificapp/plugin.-The`.voicebox.zip`extensionishighlyspecific.It\'snotastandardaudioformat(like.mp3,.wav,.ogg).It\'slikelyacustomarchiveformatusedbyaspecificapplication,possiblyamod,agameasset,oraspecializedtool.-Let\'sthinkaboutknownprojects:There\'sawell-knownprojectcalled"Voicebox"byJamiePine,butI\'mnotimmediatelyfamiliar with it.Itmightberelatedto"Voicebox"forUnrealEngine,oravoicechanger,oramoddingtool.-Actually,searchingmyknowledgebase:`jamiepine/voicebox`mightberelatedtoaspecificsoftware.Wait,JamiePineisknownforopen-sourceprojects,butIshouldbecareful.Theusermentions`.voicebox.zip`.Thisstronglysuggestsacustomformat.-Ishouldcheckifthisaknownformat.It\'slikelyacompressedarchivecontainingvoicedataforaspecificapplication.Theprojectmightbeatooltocreate,extract,ormodifythesearchives.-SinceIcan\'tbrowsetheliverepo,I\'llneedtoguidetheuseronhowtofindtheanswerintherepoitself,explaincommonpatternsforsuchformats,andaskforclarificationifneeded.I\'llalsoadheretomyconstraints:beaccurate,clear,concise,andfollowthe language.4.**FormulateResponse(MentalRefinement):**-Acknowledgetheprojectandthe`.voicebox.zip`format.-Explainthat`.voicebox.zip`islikelyacustom/archiveformatspecifictothistooloritstargetapplication.-Providegeneralstepsonhowtohandleit:a.Checktherepo\'sREADMEforimport/exportinstructions.b.Lookfordocumentation/wikionthe`.voicebox.zip`structure.c.ItmightbeastandardZIPfilewithacustomextension(tryrenamingto`.zip`andextracting).d.CheckiftheprojectprovidesaCLI/GUItooltogenerateorconvertaudiointothisformat.e.Lookatthe`scripts/`or`assets/`foldersforexamples.-Asktheusertosharetherepo\'sREADMEorspecificerrormessagesiftheyneedmoreprecisehelp.-KeepitconciseandinChinese.Structure:-直接回答：该格式通常是项目自定义的音频归档包。-提供具体操作建议：重命名测试、查阅文档、使用项目工具转换、查看示例。-提醒：由于无法实时访问GitHub，建议结合仓库文档操作。-保持准确、简洁。5.**Self-Correction/Verificationduringthought:**-Is`.voicebox.zip`aknownstandard?No.It\'salmostcertainlyacustomformat.\n   - Could it be related toaspecificgameorsoftware?Possibly.Ishouldmentionthat.-Imustavoidmakinguptechnicaldetails.I\'llsticktogeneral,actionableadviceandexplicitlystatethatIcan\'taccesslivereposbutcanguidebasedoncommonpractices.-I\'llensurethetoneishelpfulanddirect.-Checkconstraints:NoexternalAImentions,nopolicytalk,concise,Chinese.Draft:`.voicebox.zip`通常是该项目或其所依附软件自定义的音频归档格式，并非通用音频文件。导入声音的一般步骤如下：1.**确认是否为标准ZIP**：尝试将后缀`.voicebox.zip`直接改为`.zip