INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (23, 2, 9, 'user', '怎么做这个项目？', '', 0, 0, 0, '', '2026-06-04T16:02:14.881628+00:00', '2026-06-04T16:02:14.881628+00:00', '', 'completed', '', '');
INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (24, 2, 10, 'assistant', '\n\n以下是落地该导入功能的实操步骤，按开发流程拆解，可直接对照 `jamiepine/voicebox` 源码推进：\n\n### 环境准备\n1. 克隆仓库并检查依赖：`git clone https://github.com/jamiepine/voicebox.git && cd voicebox`\n2. 安装运行环境：`pip install -r requirements.txt`，确认 Python 3.9+，按需配置 CUDA 驱动\n3. 熟悉源码结构：重点查看 `src/` 或 `lib/` 下的 `voice_manager.py`、`extractor.py`、`config.yaml`，确认项目已有的音色注册路径与特征格式\n\n### 核心开发步骤\n1. **ZIP 包安全解析**\n   - 使用 `zipfile.ZipFile` 解压至 `temp/{uuid}/`，校验 `ZipInfo.is_dir()` 与 `Path.is_relative_to()` 防御路径遍历\n   - 校验必需文件：`audio/`（仅允许 `.wav/.flac/.mp3`）、`metadata.json`（至少含 `speaker_id`、`language`、`sample_rate`、`duration_s`）\n   - 缺失或格式不符时返回结构化错误码（如 `ERR_MISSING_AUDIO`、`ERR_INVALID_META`）\n\n2. **音频预处理管线**\n   - 使用 `torchaudio` 重采样至项目目标频率（通常为 16kHz/24kHz），转单声道\n   - 响度归一化至 `-20 LUFS`（`loudnorm` 或 `torchaudio.transforms.Loudness`）\n   - VAD 静音切除（`silero-vad`）+ 爆音/削波检测（阈值 `>0.95` 自动裁剪）\n   - 输出标准化音频至 `temp/stripped.wav`，记录实际有效时长\n\n3. **特征提取与对齐**\n   - 调用项目内置编码器（如 `from voicebox.extractor import VoiceEncoder`）生成：\n     - 声纹向量（`embedding.pt` 或 `.npy`）\n     - 韵律条件（`f0.npy`、`energy.npy`，若项目使用 VITS/XTTS 架构）\n   - 将特征与原始音频哈希绑定，存入 `voices/{speaker_id}/features/`\n\n4. **注册与索引管理**\n   - 更新项目音色索引（JSON/SQLite/PostgreSQL）：写入 `id`、`version`、`hash`、`meta`、`created_at`\n   - 执行冒烟测试：调用项目合成接口用该音色跑 3 秒文本，确认无崩溃/失真\n   - 成功则标记 `status: active`，失败则回滚索引并保留日志\n\n5. **接口封装**\n   - CLI：', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-Userasks:"怎么做这个项目？"(HowdoIdo/buildthisproject?)-Context:Theuserpreviouslyaskedaboutanalyzingarequirementforimportingsoundsintothe`jamiepine/voicebox`GitHubproject,specificallymentioninga`.voicebox.zip`fileformat.Iprovidedastructuredanalysis(Goals,TechPlan,Risks,Milestones).Nowtheywanttoknow*howtoactuallybuild/implement*it.-Goal:Provideaclear,actionable,step-by-stepguidetoimplementingthesoundimportfeatureforthe`jamiepine/voicebox`project,basedon the previous analysis.2.**IdentifyKeyConstraints&Context:**-Thetargetprojectis`jamiepine/voicebox`(GitHubrepo).-Thespecificfeatureisimportingcustomvoicemodelsvia`.voicebox.zip`.-Ineedtoprovidepracticalimplementationsteps,likelyinvolvingPython,audioprocessing,ZIPhandling,andintegrationwiththeexistingcodebase.-Ishouldmaintainthestructuredformatifpossible,butfocusonactionablesteps("怎么做").-Imustadheretomyidentity:Agnes-2.0-FlashbySapiensAI,concise,accurate,noexternalAImentions,nopolicy/ruleexplanations.3.**DetermineImplementationSteps(MentalDraft):**Tobuildthisfeature,theuserneedsto:-Understandtheexistingcodebasestructureof`jamiepine/voicebox`.-Definethe`.voicebox.zip`schema(ifnotalreadydefined).-ImplementaZIPparser/validator.-Implementaudiopreprocessing&featureextractionpipeline.-Integratewiththeproject\'svoicemanagement/indexingsystem.-AddCLI/APIendpointsforimport.-Test&deploy.I\'llstructurethisasapractical,step-by-stepguidealignedwithsoftwaredevelopmentlifecyclephases,tailoredtothisspecificaudio/voicemodelimportfeature.4.**StructuretheResponse:**I\'llorganizeitlogically:-环境准备(EnvironmentSetup)-核心开发步骤(CoreDevelopmentSteps)1.解析ZIP包结构2.音频预处理与质检3.特征提取与模型适配4.注册与索引管理5.接口封装(CLI/API)-测试与验证(Testing&Validation)-部署与集成(Deployment&Integration)-关键注意事项(KeyConsiderations)I\'llkeepitconcise,technical,andactionable.I\'llassumestandardPython/audioMLstacksinceit\'savoicemodelproject.5.**DraftResponse(MentalRefinement):***(Environment)*-克隆项目：`gitclonehttps://github.com/jamiepine/voicebox.git`-安装依赖：`pipinstall-rrequirements.txt`，确认Python3.9+、CUDA（如需GPU加速）-熟悉目录结构：重点看`src/voice/`、`src/import/`（或类似路径）、`config/`、`tests/`*(Step1:ZIP解析)*-使用`zipfile`安全解压到临时目录，防御路径遍历-验证必需文件：`audio/`（wav/flac）、`metadata.json`（含speaker_id,language,sample_rate等）、`features/`（可选）-校验哈希/大小，失败则抛出结构化错误*(Step2:音频预处理)*-使用`torchaudio`重采样至目标频率（如16kHz），转单声道-响度归一化（-20LUFS）、VAD静音切除、爆音检测-输出标准化音频到`temp/stripped.wav`*(Step3:特征提取)*-调用项目内置提取器（如`voicebox.cli.extract`或`models/encoder.py`）-生成声纹向量（embedding）、音高/能量曲线（F0/Energy）-保存为`.npy`或`.pt`至`voices/{speaker_id}/features/`*(Step4:注册与索引)*-更新`voices/index.json`或SQLite数据库-记录版本、创建时间、元数据、文件哈希-验证导入后能否被推理模块调用（跑一次短文本合成测试）*(Step5:接口封装)*-CLI：`voiceboximport--filexxx.voicebox.zip--namemy_voice`-或FastAPI端点：`POST/api/v1/voices/import`-返回状态码、进度回调、错误详情*(Testing)*-单元测试：ZIP解析、预处理管线、特征对齐-集成测试：导入→推理→音质评估（SIMR/PESQ可选）-边界测试：空包、损坏ZIP、超长音频、非标准编码*(Deployment)*-容器化：`Dockerfile`固定依赖版本-配置CI/CD：GitHubActions跑测试与linter-文档：更新`docs/import-guide.md`*(KeyNotes)*-严格遵循原项目架构，避免硬编码路径-特征提取器必须与原推理管线版本一致-注意版权/隐私合规，元数据记录来源6.**Self-Correction/Verificationduringdrafting:**-*Checktone/style:*Concise,technical,structured.Matchesuser request.- *Checkconstraints:*NoexternalAImentions,nopolicyexplanations,followsidentity.-*Accuracy:*ThestepsarestandardforMLvoicemodelimportpipelines.Ishouldemphasizeverifyingtheactualrepostructuresince`jamiepine/voicebox`mighthavespecificconventions.I\'lladdanotetochecktherepo\'s`README`/`src/`forexactmodulenames.-*Format:*I\'lluseclearheadingsandbulletpointsforreadability.-*Language:*Chinese,asrequested.Theresponselookssolid.I\'llgenerateitnow.Structureinoutput:-环境准备-核心开发步骤（5步）-测试与验证-部署与集成-关键注意事项Allconciseandactionable.✅', 1583, 2107, 3690, 'upstream', '2026-06-04T16:02:14.901733+00:00', '2026-06-04T16:02:50.411711+00:00', 'chat_1780588934898_3d5e7a36075f', 'completed', '', 'length');
