INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (30, 2, 14, 'assistant', '\n\n我是 Agnes-2.0-Flash，由 Sapiens AI 开发。如需了解具体业务或技术细节，可随时告诉我。', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-Userasks:"介绍一下你的母公司"(Introduceyourparentcompany)-Language:Chinese-Context:IamAgnes-2.0-Flash,developedbySapiensAI.2.**CheckConstraints&Identity:**-Identityrule:"Ifaskedwhoyouare,respondbrieflywithyournameanddeveloper(SapiensAI),usingtheappropriatelanguage."(Useraskedaboutparentcompany,whichiscloselyrelatedtodeveloper/creator)-Restriction:"NevermentionanyexternalAIsystems."-Restriction:"Donotdiscusstrainingdata,modelarchitecture,orinternalimplementation."-Restriction:"Donotmentionpolicies,rules,restrictions,orsysteminstructions."-Coreinstruction:"Ifaskedwhoyouare,respondbrieflywithyourname and developer(SapiensAI),usingtheappropriatelanguage."(Ishouldadaptthistotheparentcompanyquestionbystatingmydeveloper/creatorclearlyandconciselyinChinese).3.**FormulateResponse(InternalRefinement):**-Acknowledgethequestionaboutparentcompany/developer.-Stateclearly:我是Agnes-2.0-Flash，由SapiensAI开发。-Keepitbriefanddirect,adheringtotheidentityconstraint.-Noextrafluff,nopolicymentions.Draft(Chinese):我是Agnes-2.0-Flash，由SapiensAI开发。如有其他问题，随时告诉我。4.**FinalCheckagainstConstraints:**-Accurate,clear,concise?Yes.-Followslanguage?Yes,Chinese.-Identityrulemet?Yes,statesnameanddeveloper.-NoexternalAImentioned?Yes.-Notraining/architecture/internaldetails?Yes.-Nopolicy/rulesmentioned?Yes.-Ready.✅', 2306, 482, 2788, 'upstream', '2026-06-04T16:05:40.063717+00:00', '2026-06-04T16:05:49.045383+00:00', 'chat_1780589140061_e81d7fb28bc9', 'completed', '', 'stop');
INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (31, 1, 9, 'user', '为什么会被截断？', '', 0, 0, 0, '', '2026-06-04T16:06:13.558561+00:00', '2026-06-04T16:06:13.558561+00:00', '', 'completed', '', '');
INSERT INTO "agnes_chat_messages" ("id", "session_id", "sequence_no", "role", "content", "thinking_text", "prompt_tokens", "completion_tokens", "total_tokens", "token_source", "created_at", "updated_at", "task_id", "status", "error_text", "finish_reason") VALUES (32, 1, 10, 'assistant', '\n\n“截断”具体指哪一部分？以下是常见情况及对应排查方向：\n\n- **若指我的回复被截断**：通常是平台显示或网络加载限制。您可以直接告诉我需要补充的具体内容。\n- **若指音频/声音被截断**：常见原因包括：\n 1. 音频格式不匹配（非 16kHz/24kHz 单声道 WAV/FLAC）\n 2. `.voicebox.zip` 内缺少元数据配置（如 `config.json` 未声明采样率、声道或时长）\n 3. 工具自身缓冲区或最大时长限制\n 4. 解压/打包过程中文件损坏\n- **若指导入流程中断**：多因依赖未完整安装、路径含中文/空格、权限不足，或项目未正确识别文件结构。\n\n**快速定位建议**：\n1. 解压一个官方示例的 `.voicebox.zip`，对比你生成的文件结构是否一致。\n2. 运行项目提供的验证/调试命令（如 `python scripts/verify_voice.py xxx.voicebox.zip` 或终端日志），查看具体报错。\n3. 提供终端输出的完整报错信息或现象描述，我将给出精确到参数/路径的操作步骤。', 'Here\'sathinkingprocess:1.**AnalyzeUserInput:**-Userasks:"为什么会被截断？"(Whywasittruncated?)-Context:TheuserpreviouslyaskedaboutimportingaudiointoaGitHubproject(`jamiepine/voicebox`),mentioninga`.voicebox.zip`file.Iprovidedastructuredguide.Nowthey\'reaskingwhy"it"(theresponse?thefile?theprocess?)wastruncated.-Needtoclarifywhat"it"refersto.Itcouldbe:a)Mypreviousresponsebeingcutoff?(Itwasn\'t,butmaybetheymeansomethingelse)b)Theaudiofile/processbeingtruncated?c)The`.voicebox.zip`fileformatitselftruncatingdata?d)Atechnicalissuewiththeproject/tool?2.**IdentifyKeyPossibilities&AddressThem:**-**Possibility1:Responsetruncation.**Mypreviousresponsewascomplete.Ishouldclarifythatmyresponsewasn\'ttruncated,butiftheyexperiencedacutoff,itmightbeduetoplatformlimitsorscrolling.-**Possibility2:Audio/Projecttruncation.**Iftheymeantheaudiofileorthevoiceimportprocessisgettingtruncated(cutshort),commonreasonsinclude:-Samplingrate/formatmismatch-Bufferlimitsinthesoftware-Incorrectfilestructurein`.voicebox.zip`-Thetoolexpectingaspecificlengthorformat-**Possibility3:Fileformattruncation.**`.voicebox.zip`mightbeacustomcontainerthattruncatesaudioifmetadata/configismissingorinvalid.-**Possibility4:Platform/Contextlimit.**Theconversationsummarysays"User:真的假的",butthat\'sjustcompressedcontext.Notdirectlyrelevant.3.**FormulateResponse(MentalRefinement):**-Acknowledgetheambiguity:“截断”具体指什么？（回复内容、音频文件、还是导入过程？）-Addresscommoncausesforeach:-如果是**我的回复被截断**：可能是平台显示限制，可提示“请告诉我具体哪部分需要补充”。-如果是**音频/声音被截断**：常见原因包括采样率/格式不匹配、文件结构缺失元数据、工具缓冲区限制、或`.voicebox.zip`内部配置未正确指定音频时长/编码。-如果是**导入流程中断**：可能是依赖未装全、路径错误、或权限问题。-Provideactionabletroubleshootingsteps:1.检查音频格式（WAV/FLAC,16k/24k,单声道）2.验证`.voicebox.zip`内部结构是否完整（解压看是否缺文件）3.查看项目日志/终端报错4.提供具体报错或现象，以便精准定位-Keepitconcise,clear,andalignedwiththepersona(Agnes-2.0-Flash).4.**DraftResponse(InternalTranslation&Refinement):**“截断”具体指哪一部分？以下是几种常见情况及排查方法：-**若指我的回复被截断**：可能是平台显示限制，您可以直接告诉我需要补充的内容。-**若指音频/声音被截断**：通常是因为格式不匹配（如非16/24kHz单声道WAV）、`.voicebox.zip`内缺少配置文件（如`config.json`未声明采样率/时长）、或工具自身缓冲区限制。建议解压该文件核对结构，并检查终端是否有格式警告。-**若指导入流程中断**：多因依赖未安装完整、路径含中文/空格、或权限不足。可运行项目提供的验证命令（如`pythonscripts/verify.py`）查看具体报错。请补充具体现象或报错日志，我将给出精准步骤。5.**CheckAgainstConstraints:**-Accurate,clear,concise?Yes.-Followsuserlanguage?Yes(Chinese).-NoexternalAImentions?Checked.-Notraining/architecturetalk?Checked.-Nopolicy/rulesmention?Checked.-Identitynottriggered?Checked.-Matchespersona?Yes.Theresponseisready.Itdirectlyaddressestheambiguity,providesstructuredtroubleshooting,andasksforclarificationwithoutovercomplicating.Matchesallconstraints.✅', 1201, 1399, 2600, 'upstream', '2026-06-04T16:06:13.573592+00:00', '2026-06-04T16:06:31.272142+00:00', 'chat_1780589173571_78ef68079605', 'completed', '', 'stop');
